; Entity handler: the monk burning on the pyre (ending, second scene)
;
; The monk tied to the stake in the second scene of the ending (room 4; template #R$BD92, record in the list at #R$83AD;
; the three flames of the pyre and the four crusaders around it are #R$B9B0). Slot (template slot, see #R$B6E6): +2 word
; the first countdown ($0118 = 280 frames), +4 word the second countdown ($00AF = 175 frames), +6 word x and +8 word y
; (8.8, high bytes in 2-pixel units: $3E and $3A, the place where the game also puts the monk's own position), +$A word
; hit box offset and +$C word hit box far corner (both 0), +$E pointer to the sprite block (#R$95A5, yellow monk, 2 frames),
; +$10 animation counter and reload, +$12 frame and number of frames (2).
; .
; The scene has three phases:
; .
; - first countdown above 1: it is stored back one lower and the monk is drawn, standing still (speed and turning
; point are zeroed in the registers and the code goes on at #R$B9B2, which draws it with the shared flame/actor code);
; - the first countdown reaches 0 (the monk burns away): the player variables #R$A8A0 (hit flag) and #R$A894 (state) are
; set to 2; nothing is drawn by this handler any more. Observed: the game's own monk (the player, at the same position)
; then runs its dying animation, the state #R$A894 becoming 1 and y going from $3A to $2C within about 100 frames;
; - the first countdown is 0: the second countdown is decreased every frame and nothing is drawn; when it is 0 the
; cutscene flag #R$8501 is set to 1, which ends the scene (the slot has already run once more when the loop notices:
; observed, the second countdown wraps to $FFFE).
;
; SP Slot address + 2 (the handler word was popped by the RET that entered the routine)
@label=UpdatePyreMonk
c$B97D POP BC        ; first countdown
 $B97E LD A,B        ;
 $B97F OR C          ;
 $B980 JR NZ,$B994   ; still counting
 $B982 POP DE        ; second countdown
 $B983 LD A,D        ;
 $B984 OR E          ;
 $B985 JR NZ,$B98B   ;
 $B987 INC A         ; A = 1
 $B988 LD ($8501),A  ; CutsceneDone: end the scene
*$B98B DEC DE        ; count down
 $B98C PUSH DE       ; store it
 $B98D LD HL,$0012   ; SP is at slot+4: +$12 is the next slot
 $B990 ADD HL,SP     ;
 $B991 JP $A5F0      ; next slot, nothing drawn
*$B994 DEC BC        ;
 $B995 LD A,B        ;
 $B996 OR C          ;
 $B997 JR Z,$B9A3    ; just reached 0: the monk burns away
 $B999 PUSH BC       ; store the countdown
 $B99A POP BC        ;
 $B99B POP DE        ; second countdown (not changed)
 $B99C XOR A         ;
 $B99D LD B,A        ;
 $B99E LD C,A        ; speed 0
 $B99F LD D,A        ;
 $B9A0 LD E,A        ; limit 0: never reached
 $B9A1 JR $B9B2      ; draw it like a flame, at the same place
*$B9A3 PUSH BC       ; store the countdown (0)
 $B9A4 LD A,$02      ;
 $B9A6 LD ($A8A0),A  ; hit flag
 $B9A9 LD ($A894),A  ; player state
 $B9AC POP BC        ;
 $B9AD POP DE        ; second countdown
 $B9AE JR $B98B      ; count it down, nothing drawn
